# PCT Support Layer Protocol

> [!abstract] Owns the non-drug recovery floor during PCT.
> Product owners include [[Vitamin D3-K2 (125mcg×180tab) — iHerb]], [[Zinc (50mg×120tab) — iHerb]], [[Boron (5mg×240tab) — iHerb]], [[Ashwagandha (600mg×120tab) — iHerb]], [[Magnesium Glycinate (210mg×240tab) — iHerb]], [[Glycine (1000mg×100tab) — iHerb]], and [[Methyl B Complex (250mg×60tab) — iHerb]].

> [!important] Role
> This layer does not restart the HPTA by itself. It reduces avoidable stressors so the medical PCT plan has a better environment.

## What This Protocol Owns

- Training deload and recovery workload during PCT.
- Protein, calories, fats, micronutrients, and sleep support.
- Stress control and lifestyle factors that can mask or worsen low-test symptoms.
- Stock math for recovery supplements and food.

